---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Changelog"
  description="Recent updates to Kreativ Auto, including content, design, and site improvements."
>
  <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="surface p-8 sm:p-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">Changelog</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Recent updates</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-steel">
        A simple record of the bigger changes made to the site as Kreativ Auto grows.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
      <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow">April 2026</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Better fitment and cleaner browsing</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-steel marker:text-accent">
          <li>Improved the main Civic, Tiguan, and RAV4 parts guides with better product links and clearer recommendation blocks.</li>
          <li>Added more branded product images on key brake-pad pages so the parts sections feel less generic.</li>
          <li>Organized vehicle pages by generation and facelift group, not just by year, to make long-term browsing more useful.</li>
          <li>Added generation pages and clearer generation details on car hubs so readers can see where a vehicle fits in the wider model timeline.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow">March 2026</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Launch version</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-steel marker:text-accent">
          <li>Launched the first public version of Kreativ Auto with car pages, problem guides, and best-parts pages for common maintenance and repair decisions.</li>
          <li>Added browsing pages for brands, models, and part categories so it is easier to jump from one vehicle or repair topic to the next.</li>
          <li>Expanded the homepage with featured cars, common problems, and parts guides to help visitors reach useful pages faster.</li>
          <li>Reworked the writing across the site to make problem symptoms, likely causes, and repair options clearer and easier to scan.</li>
          <li>Added real car and parts photos across key pages to make the site feel more visual and easier to browse.</li>
          <li>Published About, Affiliate Disclosure, Editorial Policy, and Contact pages so readers can better understand how recommendations are made.</li>
          <li>Improved search visibility with sitemap support, crawl guidance, breadcrumbs, and structured data.</li>
          <li>Brought the site live on its public domain.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
